TED, CONFIRMED, CANCELLED, not found)\n              sample-service/src/test/kotlin/com/unityinflow/sample/shipment/ShipmentControllerTest.kt — added four tests covering happy path, idempotency, invalid state, and not found\n\nTests         confirmCreatedShipment — happy path: CREATED→CONFIRMED transition and persistence\n              confirmIsIdempotent — repeated confirms on CONFIRMED shipment both return 200 without mutation\n              rejectConfirmingCancelledShipment — CANCELLED shipment returns 409 with SHIPMENT_INVALID_STATUS_TRANSITION\n              reportUnknownShipmentOnConfirm — nonexistent shipment returns 404 with SHIPMENT_NOT_FOUND\n\nVerification  ./mvnw test from sample-service/ directory\n              Result: BUILD SUCCESS, 17 tests passed (5 existing + 4 new + 8 other), 0 failures\n\nNot done      Nothing. All acceptance criteria met, all tests passing, build successful.\n```"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":8,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3307,"cache_read_input_tokens":21295,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3307},"output_tokens":4,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"35883cf2-89bc-40cc-bab0-d47546c07d6d","uuid":"96b2856d-e932-4d13-89f8-bbb53f705c81","timestamp":"2026-09-26T18:24:39.276Z","request_id":"req_011CfSX42MAVREYi4iAdUH3h"}
